                "that PIN plus a name for the device into the Device Name / "
                "PIN fields on the main window and press Pair Device — no "
                "need to open Sunshine's own web page yourself. The device "
                "name field remembers the last one you used.",
            ),
            (
                "Local Host Setting",
                "Menu → Preferences → Sunshine API sets the host and port "
                "Magic talks to. It defaults to Sunshine's standard local "
                "address — only change this if you've moved Sunshine's web "
                "port.",
            ),
            (
                "Sunshine Credentials",
                "Menu → Sunshine Credentials sets the same username/password "
                "you use to log into Sunshine's web UI. Required once before "
                "pairing works — stored in GNOME Keyring, not in a plain "
                "file.",
            ),
            (
                "Elevated Actions",
                "Toggling modes changes system-wide sleep targets and the "
                "Ethernet Wake-on-LAN flag via a small, fixed root helper "
